WHAT YOU MAY DO
---------------
  * Use this mod, for free, for as long as you like.
  * Share it, re-upload it, mirror it, include it in a modpack.
  * Modify the translation, fix it, build on it, translate it onward.

  As long as you credit Krirk0137 and link back to
  https://github.com/krirk0137/PassTheFearModThai


WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO
-------------------
  * Sell it, or any modified version of it.
  * Put it behind a paywall, a subscription, or a "pay to download" link.
  * Bundle it with anything sold for money.
  * Use it in advertising or any other commercial arrangement.

  This applies whether the money is for the mod itself or for access to it.


DONATIONS
---------
  Voluntary donations to the author are welcome and are not a sale: nothing is
  withheld from anyone who does not pay, and the mod stays free for everyone.

  Anyone else redistributing this mod must not solicit payment for it.


