NOTE ON APPLYING CC TO CODE
---------------------------
  Creative Commons does not recommend CC licenses for software, and this
  repository does contain a small amount of C#. It is licensed here anyway, on
  purpose: the intent — free to use and share, never to sell — is the same for
  the plugin as for the translation, and splitting the two would only invite the
  reading that one half may be sold.
